# GPS: a multi-constellation 3D fix (GPS and SBAS under $GP, GLONASS under $GL, one $GNGSA per system, multi-message GSV
# groups): thirteen satellites used, HDOP 0.9: three green bars. Then the feed ends: after 5 s the bars are dimmed with the
# "!" mark (stale). tests/tools/check_chip_shots.py measures the shots.
title GPS: sky of three constellations, good fix, then stale
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED skylost
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1500
shot sky-good
expect text "Map"
wait 5000
shot sky-stale
expect text "Map"
